	(text "Version History:\nV1.0: Designed for 5V H2 sensor using non-latching TTL.\n2025/03 Questioned making a TTL converter for Hydroknowz with 0-3V proportional output. Bought a new sensor instead.\nV1.1: Redesigned for 12V Hydroknowz with latching, active-high TTL. (should have been called V2 but oh well)\nV2.0: Updated for external production. These are non-functional.\nV2.1: Moved Solenoid to parallel configuration with safety relay. Tested with 5V TTL, so H2 sensor (3V TTL) does not work with this.\nV2.2: Changed FET to IRLB8748 (TO-220AB) as V_GS was >3V on SIR680DP. Temporary change for comp, this will be updated \n      for next season with appropriate SMD replacement...\n\n2026/04\nV3.0: Redesign using AWHSH112DM00G relays to save power (0.36W compared to 1.6W per relay).\n	 Staying on 12V supply (24V does not save any power but makes AUX battery larger/heavier).\n      2026/06 V3.0 varients made for both Metis and HydroKnowz.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.272 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4fd9538e-e101-426d-afaf-59baf4ba6f7b")
	)
	(text "0-3V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 164.846 89.916 0)
